{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_grabds_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_grabds_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"舊夢重溫","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_grabds_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"986efc761a11b12b52380a2f1b9232546b409b26a25887ea27df140677868250","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"風很慢很慢地吹過來，吹到身上的時候，就像個調皮的小朋友一樣搖你的袖子。\n它帶來很多新奇的氣味跟你分享：油菜籽被榨出金色的油、稻桿被捆起來後堆在一起、米粒在鍋裡翻滾出熱氣……\n於是你就知道了這片田野裡正在發生的一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g20_skyblue_L1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"黍姐姐說，她這趟從大荒城來羅德島時，就經過了這樣一片田野。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調皮的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是麥田嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不光是麥田。還有稻子、高粱和野草。好多我叫不出名字的花花草草，都長得好高好高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"從這片田野中，伸出一條窄窄的土路來。剛下過雨，地上全是煩人的泥坑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，小滿，不要下雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，那就換成晴天好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g16_sunnyday_R2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"晴天，小蟲子和小羽獸也會開心，嘰嘰喳喳地叫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，太陽把草地曬得暖烘烘的，那些耐不住熱的小蟲子，全都躲到路邊的樹蔭裡了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的天氣，好舒服……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是不是已經想要打個瞌睡了？別忘了你們答應我的喔，聽完這個故事，就要乖乖去睡覺了。醫生們也說過了，一定要確保充足的睡眠才行喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調皮的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小滿小滿，那你呢，你不去睡嗎？你還要等黍姐姐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她今天有好多事要做，肯定不會來了。等你們睡著了，我也會趕快休息的，我可不想把自己拖成重感冒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小滿小滿，你繼續講啊——我們保證會聽話的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……這時候，從遠處跑來一輛車子，車斗裡裝滿了剛採收下來的糧食，上方還蓋著一層厚厚的稻草。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調皮的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要蓋一層稻草？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因為駕駛這輛車的年輕農夫，急著將糧食運送到糧站去。他擔心糧食在路上被雨淋濕了，就幫糧食蓋上一層稻草被子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是他還是很擔憂……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明是大晴天，怎麼總是有朵烏雲跟著我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，我得再開快一點，要是雨落下來……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉喲！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼事了？小滿……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別怕，沒人受傷。只是他剛轉過轉角，就發現前面的路被堵住了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！這牧獸和馱獸是誰的，快來人把牠們牽走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒人理他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他走近一看，馱獸的脖子上沒有韁繩，耳朵上也沒有釘標籤。牧獸倒是套著鞍具，但他再怎麼用力也拉不動這頭牧獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"頭頂的烏雲越來越近，年輕的農夫急得抓頭。他忽然有了主意，到車斗裡抓出一把稻草……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，好吃的！過來就給你吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘬嘬嘬——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的馱獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1163_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"動物也不理他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調皮的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"牠們為什麼要擋在路上不走呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦？！要是下雨了，我這一車糧食就全都報銷了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，這不會是什麼搶劫的招數吧？難道樹蔭裡還有人躲著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他想多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走啊！喂！駕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我車裡好像有條鞭子，以前在草地上拿來開路用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小滿……"},{"type":"narration","text":"年輕的農夫取出鞭子，猶豫著。馱獸和牧獸安靜地看著他，沒有害怕，也沒有動。\n烏雲慢慢飄過來。\n鞭子被高高舉起——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"住手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的小妹妹","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快住手！我有辦法把牠們弄走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調皮的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小滿！你怎麼跑到故事裡去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這不是我，這只是一個恰巧路過的小妹妹，嗯！我只是……扮演一下她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼乖巧的牧獸、這麼安分的馱獸，你怎麼忍心用鞭子抽牠們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你說，你有什麼辦法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個簡單，讓我來勸勸牠們，這種事情我可是很有經驗的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能跟動物說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恰巧路過的小妹妹走到攔路的動物身邊，突然靠近，仔細聆聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你這個小孩——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽出什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼都沒聽到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我聽不懂牠們說話了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂，小滿——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你耍賴！怎麼講故事還把自己也講進去了？你又不在那裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都說了那不是我，是個碰巧路過的小妹妹而已。我猜啊，她應該是那附近的學生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你說，她叫什麼名字？黍姐姐跟你說故事的時候，也有這個人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……問題真多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在不也進到故事裡面來了？那你又是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是一棵樹！看，嘩啦啦！朝你頭上撒葉子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_045","isRemote":false,"text":"小滿小滿，你真的能聽懂動物說話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是真的。我以前跟你們講了那麼多故事，總不可能都是我一個人編出來的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_045","isRemote":false,"text":"那，故事裡那個剛好路過的姐姐，她也能聽懂嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_045","isRemote":false,"text":"還有……我也能聽懂嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛，我倒是問過許多人，黍姐姐、笨水牛，還有博士……答案嘛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"滿懷期待的孩子們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，只要有心，就能聽懂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然說，有些動物脾氣很倔，一開始不願意和人交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但只要弄清楚牠們想做什麼，就能聽懂牠們在說什麼了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弄清楚牠們想做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜託不要和我開玩笑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這一車糧食都是大荒城培育出的新品種，要是泡了雨，糧站的老頭會扒了我的皮的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大荒城，大荒城？對啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看這隻牧獸脖子上掛的號碼牌！這是一隻從大荒城來的牧獸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像……還真的是。大荒城離這裡那麼遠，牠是怎麼跑到這裡來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，我認得你。我記得你那時懷孕了，跟在一群牧獸的最後面，慢悠悠地吃草曬太陽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的身上，怎麼有了這麼多傷口……你的孩子呢？走丟了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哞。"},{"type":"narration","text":"牧獸低下了頭。沉默的馱獸朝牠挪近了一步，牠們依偎在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，是來找你們的孩子的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，我會幫你一起找的。你能告訴我那是個什麼樣的孩子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠是個善良的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聽故事的孩子們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的說話了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠的眼睛很大、很圓，我們就叫牠圓圓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大多數時間，牠不哭也不鬧，緊緊跟著我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠的腿發抖，但還是一步一步跟上來。牠是個很堅強的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圓圓和你們……長得像嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很像。但用你們的眼睛來看的話，一點也不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠是那麼小，那麼討人喜歡……牠坐在我們的肩上時，總是輕輕地用爪子抓著肩頭，牠不想弄痛我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，可是，那孩子是怎麼走丟的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不怪牠……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不得不離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離開大荒城？為什麼？如果是為了尋找口感更新鮮的牧草，跑到河岸邊也就夠了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沿著路一直走。有的山上和河流裡沒有路，我們就踩在石頭上踏過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們的孩子，牠在路上跟丟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的馱獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1163_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以現在是要找到那個幼崽，你們才肯移開對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是從大荒城一直到這裡，這麼遠的路，要找多久才能找完？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們看那朵烏雲，說不定什麼時候雨就嘩啦啦淋下來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是也說句話啊，小妹妹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們……能不能先把路讓開，讓他過去？我可以留下來幫你們找孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能。這是出於另外的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那隻馱獸，為什麼一直不說話？牠不也是來找孩子的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同樣的原因……你還沒弄清的原因。所以牠還不會和你說話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年輕的農夫蹲在地上，歪著腦袋看向那朵越來越低的烏雲。陰影罩著樹木、道路、馱獸、牧獸和人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你們已經睏了嗎？要不然今天先講到這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調皮的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"才不要！我就是聽得太入迷了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噓，小聲一點，那邊的弟弟妹妹們剛睡著了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小滿，你悄悄告訴我好不好？那個走丟的孩子，會是什麼樣子的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把我帶到羅德島的醫生姐姐說，我的眼睛很像我媽媽……那隻幼崽也會長得像牠的爸爸媽媽嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調皮的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"牧獸都能說人話了，那牠生的孩子長什麼樣子都有可能——反正是在講故事啦，不要管那麼多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就管！我就管！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噓——你們還想不想聽後面的故事啦？我保證，你們等一下就知道那隻幼崽長什麼樣子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在那自言自語什麼呢？你不是說你有辦法搞定嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正在想辦法啊。按理說，她就是這種時候出現的……再等等好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等什麼？這老天下雨可不等人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是沒辦法，我還是去拿鞭子……實在是對不起了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她來了，等到了！你看那邊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"從路的那頭，走來一位神仙。\n她手中捏著幾棵稗子，褲腳上似乎還沾著一些泥點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的神仙","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是要往糧站去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，對！眼看就要下雨了，我得趕快走，但神仙你看，這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的神仙","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說那朵烏雲嗎？別擔心，雨落不下來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的神仙","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不必著急趕路了……前面的路已經塌了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路塌了？怎麼回事，這季節又沒有山洪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的神仙","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以更難提防。許是前幾年山體開裂的舊傷，到今天終於撐不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的神仙","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們攔在這裡，倒是救了他一命呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們……知道前面的路會塌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是另外一個原因？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一部分。我們要幫的人不只他一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的馱獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1163_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。既然你們已經知道了前路的危險，我們該走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一等！我不是已經弄清另一個原因了嗎？為什麼他還是不肯和我說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攔路的牧獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的話不必說，也能聽懂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠們……就這樣走了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"農夫一拍腦袋，鑽進車斗裡抓出一大把糧食，朝著馱獸和牧獸追過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一等！謝謝你們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——呼，為什麼，牠們看起來走得很慢，我卻追不上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的神仙","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走了就追不上了，世事如此，不必遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的神仙","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，那朵烏雲也散去了。我沒騙你吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g16_sunnyday_R1"},{"type":"narration","text":"烏雲消失無蹤，陽光填補了空缺。\n年輕的農夫撐著膝蓋氣喘吁吁，手裡的糧食抓得很緊，沒有漏下一顆。\n忽然，從車斗裡傳來一陣急促的聲響。一隻小獸探出腦袋，隨後騰的一下跳出車斗，像一朵烏雲。\n牠似乎剛睡醒，下意識地從身上抖落一大把雜亂的稻草，完全沒弄清自己是怎麼到這裡來的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷路的烏雲獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_599_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷路的烏雲獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_599_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聞到了爸爸媽媽的味道！牠們在哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小烏雲獸繞著車子轉了好幾圈，好幾次跳起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷路的烏雲獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_599_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸媽媽呢？這是哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是……圓圓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷路的烏雲獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_599_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認識我？不對，你很面熟，我見過你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼會在車斗裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷路的烏雲獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_599_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道，我就是趁著太陽很好，在稻草堆裡睡了一覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷路的烏雲獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_599_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一覺醒來，爸爸媽媽就不見了！但我明明聞到了牠們的味道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們剛剛的確在這裡！還沒走遠，你看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷路的烏雲獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_599_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的爸爸媽媽啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷路的烏雲獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_599_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷路的烏雲獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_599_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我認不出來，我只記得……牠們的氣味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"認不出來？你怎麼會認不出來呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的眼睛這麼圓，就和那隻牧獸一模一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷路的烏雲獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_599_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不記得了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是牠們還記得……牠們說你小時候不哭也不鬧，總是跟在爸爸媽媽後面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠們說你連路也走不穩，卻還是一步一步堅持往前走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠們說你坐在牠們的肩膀上，總是輕輕地用爪子抓著肩頭，怕弄痛爸爸媽媽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷路的烏雲獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_599_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我……這就是我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小烏雲獸急得原地轉圈，幾乎要哭出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷路的烏雲獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_599_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我很多年沒見過牠們了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊，你看！那就是你的爸爸媽媽——我帶你去找牠們，好不好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"烏雲獸跳進小滿的懷裡。小滿吸吸鼻子，朝著火燒雲下面的馱獸與牧獸跑去。\n她一邊跑，一邊朝牠們喊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到你們的孩子了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉默的馱獸似乎聽到了她的喊叫，於是停下腳步，轉過身等待著。\n小滿加快腳步，想要將小烏雲獸帶到馱獸面前。\n但無論她怎麼咬牙使勁，她與那隻馱獸之間的距離始終沒有縮短。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷路的烏雲獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_599_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒用的，你追不上牠們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷路的烏雲獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_599_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠們已經……走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但那隻馱獸，明明就站在那裡，一直沒有離開。\n小滿沒有力氣了，她不得不停下來大口喘氣。夕陽下每個人的影子都是那麼細那麼長，像幾條永遠不會消失的墨痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的神仙","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的神仙","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會把圓圓送到牠的爸爸媽媽面前，我會讓圓圓能認出牠的爸爸媽媽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，真的是神仙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的神仙","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡有什麼神仙，我們都一樣，不過是有心的人罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的神仙","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說對嗎，恰好路過的小妹妹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的小妹妹","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有心……有心就能聽見，就能認出來，是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的小妹妹","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，圓圓就交給你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的神仙","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，我保證……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼回來了？那個幼崽呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的小妹妹","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交給那位神仙了，她一定會將圓圓送到爸爸媽媽身邊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的小妹妹","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說……我可以搭你的車嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以啊，你要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正雨落不下來，我也不必趕時間了。我現在打算往回走，換另一條路去糧站。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的小妹妹","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也去糧站！後面再想別的辦法去大荒城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的農夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大荒城，大荒城可遠了。說不定路上，你還會再遇到那兩隻牧獸和馱獸呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g13_afterglow_L1"},{"type":"narration","text":"路過的小妹妹翻身跳進車斗，摔進厚厚的稻草裡面。她頭枕著手臂，注視起天上的雲霞來。\n車輛啟動，風吹起來，稻草搔在臉蛋上，癢癢的，但她並不介意。\n被太陽曬得暖烘烘的稻草，就像牧獸秋後的毛，輕柔地將女孩擁在懷中。\n女孩感覺自己就像睡在牧獸背上……牧獸，還是馱獸，還是烏雲獸？\n呼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已經睡著了嗎，小滿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"神仙……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"被子怎麼又掉了。要記得蓋好被子啊，這樣才會快點好起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"記得……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸媽媽啊……你們要……認得我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小滿又長高了一點，這床被子都快蓋不住你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"睡吧，小滿，做個好夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"夢醒之前，我會一直在這裡陪著你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
